. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZvnbKVjV6gQ7kNvwH281-9&_nc_oc=AdrmsrfQIwDCcpHbeTqiPjdjA3qfrzyxQ2-X-jOoGvdbNqzwy_v5ml1g9OfKcAk9TQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3ryaWJcG_q_XVTrD4TMlXzM2Y5tylFpv8mU2ZsUQtN4Q&oe=69F4A43E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fhu_DMdbonwQ7kNvwGxsbgs&_nc_oc=Adrdm_isEbE5PS33yLTd1k0_gUvbG0UaBzi0qjP5RL2w8EVJ6W1tfx-gwBCkTMWQNuM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2uW87yT9vf2cyCWtLre0YNvLcAgRGlPBN8_Eq9_gN7MA&oe=69F4BADE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rqEEj5HWcvEQ7kNvwGGQgHe&_nc_oc=AdoIP0_ZdgfspKG69hwuXFZA2aGn4vamImbyJ44KOiX7LXVwp9yJAcfh4ocbvImNHaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3mGkmksDRMvgjRhNMw65-fuV8Rwq8rouNWFFMyvGehog&oe=69F4B05B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco